//! Phase 1 acceptance: round trips, migration from old versions, missing and
//! future versions, broken references, duplicate ids, incompatible skeletons
//! and dependency cycles, over small committed fixtures.
//!
//! `tests/fixtures/v1` holds hand-written old-format files. `tests/fixtures/v2`
//! is generated by `v2_fixtures_match_the_writer` (set `REGEN_FIXTURES=1` to
//! rewrite them) so the checked-in bytes cannot drift from the codecs.

